# DevGrow Project Identity

**DevGrow** — *Where the code grows, and the programmer grows.*

Bilingual (Arabic/English) AI coding assistant for programming students. Six pedagogical modes (review, hint, concept, solution, analogy, challenge) plus a JSON scorecard. Cloud-first via OpenRouter — no local LLM runtime.

## Stack

- Next.js 16 App Router · Tailwind v4 · shadcn/ui (base-nova)
- Vercel AI SDK (`ai`, `@ai-sdk/react`) · `@openrouter/ai-sdk-provider`
- Primary model: `google/gemma-4-31b-it:free`
- Fallback model: `deepseek/deepseek-v4-flash:free`

## Canonical Paths

| Path | Purpose |
|------|---------|
| `app/` | Pages, layouts, API route handlers |
| `components/` | App components; `components/ui/` = shadcn primitives |
| `lib/` | Utilities, prompts, schemas, provider singleton |
| `docs/` | Architecture (`plan.md`), execution (`roadmap.md`), log (`project_log.md`) |

**Note:** This project uses `app/` at root — not `src/app/`.

## Scope

Follow `docs/roadmap.md` stages in order. Do not expand beyond the defined 6 modes + scorecard. For architecture details, read `@docs/plan.md` and `@docs/roadmap.md` — do not duplicate them in code comments.
